================================================================================
THIRD-PARTY MODELS - NOT COVERED BY THIS REPOSITORY'S LICENSE
================================================================================

This repository contains no model weights. It calls N-ATLaS (NCAIR1/N-ATLaS) and the
NCAIR Hausa, Igbo, Yoruba and Nigerian-accented English ASR models through an
N-ATLAS-Kit gateway. Those models are published by Awarri Technologies and the Federal
Ministry of Communications, Innovation and Digital Economy (NCAIR / NITDA) under their
own licence and terms of use. N-ATLaS is free for organisations with up to 1,000 monthly
active users; larger deployments need a commercial licence from Awarri. Applications must
show the attribution "Powered by N-ATLaS".

The spoken replies use MMS-TTS voices, which are licensed CC-BY-NC 4.0 (non-commercial).

